{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16mini_level_act16mini_st02","groupId":"act16mini","stageId":null,"title":"不回头的车辙","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16mini/level_act16mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"375790ca0667cd70c04d04cd3a7617367e64f0778692686cc8c7469de7461b1a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g4_rmbtwild_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天气不错，都能看得清远处的源石晶簇。看来我们会顺利抵达目的地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沉默，又是沉默。你就没有什么话想说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当驾驶员这么长时间，我还从未遇见过像你这样无聊的乘客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，算了......哎别别别——你怎么又把它举起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就是想把窗户摇下来，通通风！我没想干别的，我保证！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能不能先把这个大家伙，从我脑袋边移开？我们好商量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续往咧嘴谷开，我不会伤害你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你劫了我的车，还用这把不知道是弩还是火炮的玩意指着我，却说不会伤害我？这里面装的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是特制的箭，感染生物很怕它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实比较希望你的答案是“胡萝卜”或者“糖果”，而不是“箭”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过还好，我不是感染生物，看来暂时还不需要太怕它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你要是一直这样指着我的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你扣下扳机，我是说如果——如果我倒下了，这辆车可怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒下了，我也能开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能开？等你接过操纵杆，它早就失控了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它会直直地冲向悬崖，或者撞进那些巨大的源石晶簇里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，就算你能开，就算这辆车也不会失控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你杀了我也就算了，可车上其他人呢？他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他，那个札拉克的安全怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你们机会下车了，是你们不走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是要你的车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就不觉得奇怪吗？别人为什么不下车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是你，我就会在心里害怕他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个肇事逃逸的冒失鬼，一个职场失意的倒霉蛋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，是一个跟踪你的便衣警察？别看他现在哆哆嗦嗦的，说不定身手了得呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁能没有一点秘密呢？你说对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于我不下车的原因嘛——作为公司的雇员，我有责任保护公司的财产安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这辆车陪伴了我这么长时间，于情于理，我都不能把它拱手让给不认识的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这本该是它..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...对了，它走向新生的旅程！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它本该开向那座每日吞吐亿万矿石的钢铁萝卜城，在乘客们的注目礼下风光地驶入载具厂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里，它会被改装成更新更酷的型号，比如装上盾构机模块，这样下次遇到天灾警报，它就能直接钻进地底躲避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我替我的车感谢你！我们将要在钢铁萝卜城开启的新生活，总算是泡汤了！拜你所赐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的话好多，语速也好快，真厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新生活？我不太懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活，在哪里都是一样......没有新旧之分，也没有差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，或许你是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，对我来说，甚至被突然出现的怪人用武器指着脑袋，都不是新鲜事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许是件伤心事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"劫车人缓缓放下了那把巨大的弩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么偏偏对这句话有反应？......算了，看来你还算有点人情味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你要把公共运载车当成你的私人专车，还不想付钱，你也该客气一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样我们这些被卷进来的人，才会心甘情愿地配合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想让任何人卷进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我打听过了，这个时间的车次，应该没有乘客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你蓄谋已久了，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算是蓄谋作案，也难免遇上意外嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，就当是我和这辆破车走大运了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等到了地方，你们就可以走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会给你钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真棒，但愿如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就按照你的“空头订单”，我们先去咧嘴谷——前提是你得保证运载车上所有人员的安全，别再把你的弩随随便便举起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，劫车的——你就好好坐着，看看窗外的风景，等着到站下车吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知过去了多久，运载车的速度慢慢减缓，直至停下来。\n它驶入了一处检查站，在此处等候通关的载具一辆接着一辆，前面的车通过关口，运载车才能再往前挪动一点。\n放在以前，这是阿兰娜最痛恨的事情。而现在，她却盼望着这场拥堵变得漫长。\n这样，她就能有更多的把握，把这辆偏航的车夺回自己手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车好多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，可能又是哪位国际大企业家在扫荡附近矿区的矿业原料吧，估计都是给他加班加点送货的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们用钱如水，我们这些在路上的家伙就得遭罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不走别的路？这条路很堵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要前往咧嘴谷，我们需要通过格林梅多自治州的检查站。没办法，这就是必经之路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过一般也不会检查什么，就是收个过路费，再做个登记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（后面的车，快点跟上来。对，很棒，这样我们就没有退路了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劫车人离开了座位，顺着车厢狭窄的通道，向后走去，似是去确认周遭的路况，片刻后又走了回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴随着劫车人再次迫近的脚步声，阿兰娜的心跳在加速。\n后视镜中看不到劫车人的全身，只能看见她的手始终握着那把弩。\n那束橄榄色的身影盖住了镜中的一切杂物，出现在了余光中，然后再一次坐在阿兰娜的身旁。\n情绪很平稳，身体也很放松。劫车人衣服的布料与座位上的皮革摩擦出细微的杂音，刚好盖过了阿兰娜的心跳声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她似乎没起疑心，还好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼......要去咧嘴谷，怎么可能只有这一条路？这条路确实是最近的，但是必须要通关检查。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（只要能和检验人员搭上话，我就有机会求救。她和她的那把弩，估计不是那些训练有素的安保人员的对手。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些车，是在躲避天灾......或者，在躲避什么不好的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么？你怎么知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车外壳上的痕迹，是感染生物留下的。还有一些粉尘......量很少，但是我能看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有车里面，人的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生事故之后，矿场的工人们，也会露出这样的表情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不知道自己应该去往何处的时候，也是这样的焦躁，不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得问问。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那边开矿渣车的老兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了，今天怎么这么堵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的驾驶员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是从双倍黑尔梅特矿区来的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是从锈渣子镇来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"双倍黑尔梅特矿区......我记得前段时间还有一帮子人风风火火地去采矿呢，说是发现了新的矿物富集区——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的驾驶员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出事故了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的驾驶员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不稳定的源石把矿井炸了个底朝天，整个矿区都没法待了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真见鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您是逃出来的？其他人状况怎样？"},{"type":"narration","text":"驾驶员忽然剧烈地咳嗽起来，阿兰娜这才注意到他的面色苍白异常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的驾驶员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......那边的人嘛，只能看运气了......但愿我的妻儿运气好点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的驾驶员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些车估计大多都和我一样，有家不能回。在现场清理完毕之前，我们只能去别的地方落个脚。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿兰娜回头看了看。\n此时的劫车人正侧头看向另一边的窗外，表情平静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要上车了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些拿着家伙的人，要上车了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"上车？可明明没有人接近这辆运载车。\n阿兰娜顺着劫车人的视线望去，才明白她在说什么。\n一帮检查站的安保人员，正和前排车辆的驾驶员交谈，另有防护装备精良的几人走进车厢，神情凶暴。\n不一会儿，驾驶员被那群人架着拖下了车，他的衣袖被划开了口子，手臂上的源石结晶显露在外，有血在流淌。\n阿兰娜忽然感到一阵莫名的不安——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在搜查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在搜查感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"在运载车的小小工具间中，小锅盖正履行着她的承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个劫车的卡特斯姐姐，好奇怪呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去，她和兰娜姐相处得还不错？她真的是来劫车的吗......噢！温米知道了！都是因为兰娜姐很厉害，能把任何人都变成好朋友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看呀，小终端里的监控画面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去......她应该没想伤害任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那我们还要回到原来的路线吗？这趟车被停掉的时间，还能再推迟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温米突然想起来，为什么大哥哥你......会在工具间呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个地方是运载车的机密空间，不对外开放的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......那个......我有点害怕......不，也不是一点，是很害怕......我还是第一次遇见劫车这种事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到这里有个门，就赶紧躲进来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，能让我留在这里吗？你看，我可以把自己缩得很小，待在角落里，不占空间，也不会打扰你工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那好吧，温米同意啦！可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你这么害怕的话，为什么不一开始就下车呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我也不知道......害怕是一回事，但心里......好像突然松了口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......下车的话可能会遇到更可怕的事......我也希望这辆车能走得越远越好，越久越好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你又为什么不下车呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我当然不能下车啦！兰娜姐还在车上，我可不能把她丢下不管呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“兰娜姐”......是这辆车的驾驶员吧？你们是家人吗？还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家人？唔......不知道呀，温米离开家很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜姐有点像爸爸，也有点像妈妈，还有点像矿工叔叔婶婶们......谁都像，那就谁也不像了，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜姐就是兰娜姐。她和朋友们打了个赌，而我是他们的赌注......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......我们应该不算是家人吧！我们只是住在一起，我们都住在这辆运载车里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"narration","text":"离开关口的通道近在眼前，紧闭的闸门却横在前方，将运载车拦下。\n几个安保人员走到驾驶室外，敲了敲窗子。\n阿兰娜短暂迟疑了一会儿，还是下了车。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老兄，什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"例行检查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一辆公共运输载具，也要检查的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这个，我可是有运营执照的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊时期，请配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对吧，前面那么多车，你们拦都没拦，直接让他们通过了。轮到我，就不行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，今天可真够走运啊。这么多“好事”，都让我撞上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官B","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）队长，别和她废话了......我刚刚去查看了这辆运载车上的标识码，他们是从比格皮勒自治州来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官B","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）要知道，比格皮勒自治州可有非常多管辖混乱的矿场，防护流程不规范，感染者可不少哩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的车辆标识码，不属于格林梅多自治州。外地来的车辆，我们都要检查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我拒绝呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们装备精良的安保团队会把你们“请”下车，送去办事处调查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能会关上你们几天、几个月，然后没收这辆肇事载具，吊销你的执照，罚一大笔钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体措施怎样，取决于你还要跟我磨蹭多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老兄，这有点太霸道了吧，我开了这么多年的运载车，过了这么多关口，也从没遇见过......"},{"type":"narration","text":"安保人员们举起了弩，指向阿兰娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照检查站的惯例，只需要驾驶员配合检验，就可以了吧？他们都是乘客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乘客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，他们都是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"说到这里，阿兰娜回过头，通过敞开的车舱门看了看运载车客舱里的状况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小锅盖躲得很好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是......那个札拉克呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还有劫车的......怎么在装填弩箭？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她。她是乘客，是买过票的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您手里这些设备，这似乎不合规矩吧？我去过那么多过路检查站，也没见过要检查矿石病感染情况的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乘客要是不愿意接受检查，我也很难办啊，要是她向运营公司投诉的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少废话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们上车。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"narration","text":"运载车上的一行人，并排坐在座位上。每个人手上都戴着矿石病检测设备。\n比起自己，阿兰娜更担心另外三个人的状态——\n小锅盖低着头，眼神空空地盯着检测设备上的进度条。\n劫车人则打量着坐在对面的安保人员，又透过敞开的门，打量着检查站的每一处角落。\n而那位不愿下车的札拉克乘客，相隔了一点距离，坐在劫车人的身旁......双腿发抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个鬼鬼祟祟躲在小隔间里的人，是怎么回事？你知道他们在车上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道，当然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你刚刚故意隐瞒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......你们态度太凶，吓得我一时忘记了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，有话可以好好说嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——谁的检测设备响了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我......我该怎么做？兰娜姐......她又会怎么做？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一颗汗珠从阿兰娜的脸颊滑落。\n检查站的工作人员丝毫没有通融的样子，那些安保人员围了上来，看上去更不好惹。\n她必须迅速想出解决当下问题的办法，不然的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......先生，尊敬的先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位乘客，她还是个小孩子。她是去格林梅多自治州......贵自治州找她的爸爸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说她爸爸在熔炼厂里做工，一年半载也回不了家......这关口的墙壁和闸机，还有这检测设备里用到的材料，可能就有她爸爸的功劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个小卡特斯......她每两个月，或许每三个月才会搭车过去一次，看看她辛苦的爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她是我们车上的常客了，以前也没有遇到过这种情况，大家通融通融也就过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尊敬的先生，您会去为难一个如此思念父亲的可怜孩子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近因为双倍黑尔梅特矿区发生了矿难，很多灾民逃往我们辖区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面的人要求我们严格管控流入的感染者，这不是通融不通融的问题，这是我们的工作，我们也没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（招了招手）动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上我都看清楚了，阿兰娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"你收养了两年，还一直藏在车上的......是个感染者？难怪你不肯把她带来见我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"......蠢透了。就为一个口头的赌局，你就做到这个份上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"就为了你那点好胜心，打死不低头的自尊心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就说过，你这样会害了自己的，还会牵连别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......尊敬的检验官老爷......我们不从这里经过了，我们原路返回，立刻！马上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看行不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"检查站也在辖区之中，你们现在已经站在这里了，就算不从这里过，也要听从安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷......您这里的过路费我照常交，我还可以额外再交一笔罚款，或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者您可以扣押这辆运载车，还可以把我带走，我来配合您调查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求求您，求求您放过那个孩子......好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小锅盖从未在阿兰娜脸上看见过这样的表情。\n在她们相处的时间里，阿兰娜一直都是勇敢的，无所畏惧的，甚至可以说是无法无天的。\n她会做鬼脸逗人，会虚夸张扬过去的经历，会毫不在意形象地放声大笑——\n可现在，她却用那样的姿态恳求着......是为了自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带下车。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用送我哦，我只是下车一小会儿，等下就来找兰娜姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个也是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也带下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"一支弩箭射出，打断了安保人员准备登车察看的动作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随后，一连串弩箭射来，逼得他们连连后退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...是那个紫发的女人！抓住她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一拳，一脚，一次弩身的猛撞。几名安保人员便被打倒在地，龇牙咧嘴。\n又是一连串的弩箭射出，穿破衣服，将那些人牢牢钉在地面上。\n劫车人跨过那些横七竖八的腿脚，来到小锅盖身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下！你们还没——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"检验官A","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去开车吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，走吧，上车！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......还好我没有试图告发这家伙。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是检测设备没报警吗？为什么也跟着下车了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我就是有点怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你们去哪儿，都行，我都跟着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倒在地上的安保人员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别想跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安保人员一把抓住了札拉克乘客的小腿，弄得他差点绊倒，重重踩在了安保人员的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倒在地上的安保人员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！！我的手指——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起！我很抱歉......我、我们先走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"围过来好多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是援兵吧......老天，这下可真闹大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十多人，手持反装甲炮的安保队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厚重的钢铁闸门，挡在前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有什么好的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"办法......哼......办法......我倒是有个好办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然太冒险，可要是真这么做了，够我吹好几年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，劫车的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这运载车，可不是普普通通的载具啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道它的全名叫什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它叫——土石开掘与瓶树移栽及人员城际运载车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道，别说搬运什么大石块和瓶树了，锈渣子镇镇口大门的那两座钢梁子，都是靠它才架起来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我就是干那事儿的驾驶员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手在抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！坐稳了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们冲关！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g4_rmbtwild_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问......有没有什么东西可以把这几个洞堵一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得......有点冷。"},{"type":"narration","text":"车身破了几个洞，荒野上的风从洞口吹进来，札拉克乘客的发型有点凌乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，先忍忍吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等会儿找个移动平台，买一点修补材料处理一下..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...等等，你怎么还在车上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我......那个......我就是普通乘客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏缩缩的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是好人！真的！你看，这是我的身份证件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，杰里......但杰里先生，我们现在可用不着好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们放心！我不会把刚才的事情随便说出去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了，事已至此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这辆车上的人，都是同伙了，谁也别想跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听到了吗，劫车的？现在我们都是劫车的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有，刚才多谢了。多谢你救了小锅盖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的检测设备也响了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被押走的话，会被送去收治区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我还要去咧嘴谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。我们现在就去咧嘴谷，这辆车现在的终点站就是咧嘴谷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，目前的燃料可能不足以开到那地方，我们还是得去移动平台补给一下，顺便处理一下我这遍体鳞伤的运载车......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，等还车的时候，可不好和公司交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你叫什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫车人","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿场的人都叫我莱伊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，莱伊。感觉还是叫“劫车的”比较顺口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劫车的，我有点好奇......你劫了这辆车，打了安保人员，这么不管不顾的......你到底想去咧嘴谷干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里基本上不通车，我听说几乎都是被天灾摧毁的荒地废墟......该不会是有什么新发现的、不为人知的宝藏吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快讲一讲！要真是什么难得一见的好东西，闹这么大也算值了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找一个巨大的阴影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......找什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个像山一样巨大的影子，在雾中会散发光线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且还会说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会......会说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？！那是什么鬼东西啊？！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
